/* ── The dashboard parts: action tiles, status rows, the facet list, the heat grid, the matrix, the bar in a cell, the
   week agenda and the run timeline [kpadopt2] ──
   Cyberpunk's own (themes/cyberpunk/CHARACTER.md): every plate is a holo card, the void with a yellow rim glowing
   inward, scan lines at 135 degrees, cut at its dossier corner (G6, G7); pointing lights the 14 px circuit in one tick
   (G8) and a press closes it (G14); a failure is locked as a target, four corner brackets in the red (G13); the machine
   speaks in prefixed mono capitals (G15); waiting is signal loss, the word LOADING deciphered over the dimmed part, once
   per waiting part and never once per cell (the register's osd); a running job is a data stream through its wire (G16).
   Hard ticks everywhere, never an ease. */
